  void WorldHelp(){var m=Studio.Modal(root,"YOUR CITY,ONE DAY AT A TIME",WorldDesk);Studio.Label(m,"Homes house residents and earn rent. Residents have limited daily needs; they do not buy coffee every minute.\n\nCafés use beans and cups to serve coffee. Their cash income is reduced by wages,power,deliveries,imports and taxes. Competition,price and walking distance affect demand.\n\nBuild farms,warehouses and utilities when their benefits outweigh their running costs. Ports can import,export genuine surplus and bring visitors for hotels.\n\nTap empty plots to build. Tap a business to inspect its margin,price,pause or move it. Changes made during a day apply tomorrow.\n\nZoom,pan and buy adjacent land to develop this same city. Operating days begin quickly and later take longer. There is no skip. You can plan while businesses operate.",44,235,632,810,26,Studio.Text);Studio.Button(m,"MY CITY",44,1110,632,110,PermanentCityScreen,true);}
